{"availability":"available","full":"rnaga/wp-next","name":"wp-next","description":"TypeScript/React page editor and admin dashboard for WordPress — no PHP, drag-and-drop canvas, dynamic data binding, and AI-native template authoring via Agent Skills.","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":14,"forks":3,"created":"2024-07-10T02:09:55Z","updated":"2026-07-26T20:17:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rnaga.github.io/wp-next/","topics":["admin-panel","cms","full-stack","headless-ui","material-ui","nextjs","react","typescript","web-builder","web-development","wordpress","wp-node"],"demo":"https://rnaga.github.io/wp-next/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T00:26:00.689Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T00:26:00.689Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T00:26:00.689Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T00:26:00.689Z","stars":14,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["For guides, concepts, and examples, the documentation site is the best starting point.","WP-Next is a TypeScript-first toolkit for building WordPress-powered Next.js applications — with a visual drag-and-drop editor, a modern React admin dashboard, and first-class AI support built in from day one."],"features":["Drag-and-drop canvas — build pages visually with a live preview. Select, resize, nest, and animate elements directly on the canvas.","Responsive design — set per-device breakpoints (desktop, tablet, mobile) and CSS states (hover, focus, etc.). Each device gets its own @media query at render time.","Dynamic data binding — pull posts, users, taxonomies, and options directly from the WordPress database into any element. No custom API endpoints required.","Widget system — embed sub-templates (widgets) inside other templates for reusable headers, footers, and components. Widget variants let the same widget render different content per embedding.","CSS variables — define design tokens at the template l